WEBVTT

00:02.970 --> 00:05.340
Listen, Saejima.

00:07.880 --> 00:10.230
I finally said it today.

00:10.560 --> 00:13.790
Said... what?

00:15.320 --> 00:16.730
What's all this?

00:16.730 --> 00:18.990
It sounds very intriguing!

00:20.100 --> 00:22.620
I said, "Would you like to live with me?"

00:24.130 --> 00:26.320
No way!

00:26.320 --> 00:31.270
When did he and Fuyutsuki-san 
get to that stage?!

00:31.270 --> 00:34.390
Don't leave your friends 
in the dark, you guys!

00:34.390 --> 00:38.610
You know I love to hear about this stuff!

00:39.860 --> 00:41.430
Fuyutsuki-san!

00:41.430 --> 00:43.770
Congratulations!

00:46.230 --> 00:47.890
For what?

00:49.090 --> 00:50.450
Oh, you!

00:50.450 --> 00:52.440
Don't play dumb with me!

00:52.440 --> 00:54.520
You're moving soon, aren't you?

00:56.240 --> 00:57.910
Moving?

00:57.910 --> 00:59.530
<i>Huh?</i>

00:59.530 --> 01:01.150
<i>What in the world?</i>

01:01.150 --> 01:07.400
<i>But Himuro-kun certainly didn't look 
like he'd been turned down... right?</i>

01:07.770 --> 01:12.410
My current apartment is enough 
for just Nyamero and me.

01:12.840 --> 01:14.660
<i>D-Don't tell me...</i>

01:15.060 --> 01:18.930
<i>Did Himuro-kun ask someone else?!</i>

01:19.960 --> 01:22.980
No way! This is too much!

01:23.020 --> 01:24.980
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

01:23.020 --> 01:24.980
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

01:23.020 --> 01:24.980
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

01:23.020 --> 01:24.980
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

