01:31.360 --> 01:35.820
<b>His Cool Female Colleague</b>

01:32.860 --> 01:35.820
<b>Episode 11


Catch Me & Touch Me</b>

01:32.860 --> 01:35.820
<b>Episode 11


Catch Me & Touch Me</b>

02:54.990 --> 02:56.060
What?!

02:56.060 --> 02:58.390
You think I invited some
 girl to live with me?

02:58.390 --> 03:00.830
Of course I didn't!

03:00.830 --> 03:02.540
Komori-san...

03:02.540 --> 03:07.690
You didn't spread that ridiculous rumor 
to Fuyutsuki-san, did you?

03:07.690 --> 03:10.160
N-No...

03:10.160 --> 03:14.080
B-But you said you asked 
someone to live with you...

03:15.280 --> 03:16.840
It was this cat.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.110
A... A cat?

03:19.110 --> 03:24.480
It's a stray cat I've been seeing around 
my neighborhood for the past month.

03:30.720 --> 03:35.360
<i>Whenever I see a cat, I get so 
excited that I start blizzarding,</i>

03:35.360 --> 03:37.680
<i>so it always gave me a wide berth, but...</i>

03:40.320 --> 03:44.370
<i>Every night, I prayed to 
the whiskers of Nyamero-san</i>

03:45.160 --> 03:48.360
<i>and trained myself with a 
George the Kitten plushie.</i>

03:48.360 --> 03:52.120
There, there. No need to be scared!

03:55.620 --> 03:58.470
C-Come here...

03:59.520 --> 04:00.760
<i>Day after day...</i>

04:00.760 --> 04:02.690
M-Morning!

04:03.750 --> 04:04.880
<i>...after day, after day...</i>

04:04.880 --> 04:06.210
Hi.

04:08.000 --> 04:09.260
<i>...after day, after day.</i>

04:09.640 --> 04:12.520
<i>And my daily persistence 
must have paid off, because...</i>

04:20.040 --> 04:21.280
<i>At last!</i>

04:24.780 --> 04:28.630
At last, I managed to restrict my blizzarding,

04:28.630 --> 04:30.680
and the cat warmed up to me.

04:30.680 --> 04:33.160
That's awesome!

04:35.300 --> 04:38.390
So you conquered the cat!

04:38.390 --> 04:43.170
"Conquered"? Is that the right word for this?

04:43.170 --> 04:47.230
I decided I might be ready 
to have a cat of my own,

04:47.230 --> 04:49.380
so I went up to that cat I see every day and...

04:50.600 --> 04:53.050
Would you like to live with me?

04:55.960 --> 04:57.740
I extended the invitation.

04:57.740 --> 04:59.470
Oh, is that all?

04:59.470 --> 05:02.190
<i>Never a dull day at this office.</i>

05:02.850 --> 05:06.340
<i>At last, my dream of living with a cat...</i>

05:06.950 --> 05:07.970
Right!

05:07.970 --> 05:10.000
<i>I've done all the image training!</i>

05:11.240 --> 05:15.190
I thought I'd take it home with me today.

05:15.560 --> 05:18.520
I bought all of these things 
in preparation, as well.

05:18.520 --> 05:20.820
I hope it goes well for you!

05:21.870 --> 05:23.520
Good afternoon, all.

05:25.580 --> 05:26.960
Fuyutsuki-san...

05:29.060 --> 05:30.600
Cat supplies?

05:31.250 --> 05:34.970
Himuro-kun... are you getting a cat?

05:34.970 --> 05:37.650
Oh, not yet.

05:37.650 --> 05:42.210
But there's a seemingly stray cat in 
my neighborhood that I'd like to adopt.

05:42.210 --> 05:43.740
I see.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.860
A stray cat...

05:45.860 --> 05:47.680
You can't help but worry.

05:47.680 --> 05:49.740
It's been very cold lately, too.

05:50.040 --> 05:54.280
You'd like as many of them to 
find warm homes as possible, right?

05:54.280 --> 05:55.440
Yes.

05:55.440 --> 06:00.050
If there's any way I can help, 
feel free to ask.

06:00.400 --> 06:03.630
Th-Thank you for the offer.

06:03.630 --> 06:07.160
I am your cat-parent "senpai," after all.

06:08.020 --> 06:09.830
Senpai...

06:09.830 --> 06:13.640
<i>Fuyutsuki-senpai? Got a nice ring to it...</i>

06:13.640 --> 06:15.810
Then, Senpai...

06:15.810 --> 06:20.520
Would you help me catch 
the cat on my way home today?

06:20.750 --> 06:21.940
Certainly.

06:24.740 --> 06:27.060
<i>He's built up a tolerance to cats...</i>

06:27.060 --> 06:30.360
<i>But he still blizzards around Fuyutsuki-san.</i>

06:41.160 --> 06:44.080
I usually see it around 
here in the mornings.

06:44.080 --> 06:45.570
I don't see it now.

06:46.010 --> 06:48.860
It could be hiding in the shrubbery.

06:48.860 --> 06:50.600
Let's have a look around.

07:08.850 --> 07:10.220
Fuyutsuki-san?

07:12.420 --> 07:14.290
It's rather nice, isn't it?

07:16.010 --> 07:20.590
The moment when you see 
familiar scenery in a new way.

07:24.110 --> 07:26.790
<i>A nighttime stroll with Fuyutsuki-san...</i>

07:26.790 --> 07:29.280
<i>I wish it could go on forever!</i>

07:31.340 --> 07:33.350
Is that the cat?

07:35.370 --> 07:36.440
It is!

07:36.440 --> 07:37.480
I thought so.

07:39.310 --> 07:42.090
Be careful. It's a little timid.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.430
Come here, dear.

07:52.330 --> 07:53.760
Hey...

07:53.760 --> 07:57.620
It took me a whole month to get that close!

07:58.690 --> 08:01.620
There's a little trick to befriending a cat.

08:02.180 --> 08:06.370
I held out out a finger and let it sniff me.

08:07.500 --> 08:09.560
Then it relaxed for me.

08:10.900 --> 08:12.420
Upsy-daisy.

08:15.030 --> 08:16.880
<i>I'm so jealous!</i>

08:17.400 --> 08:20.830
<i>Of both Fuyutsuki-san, who got 
to pick up the cat so quickly,</i>

08:20.830 --> 08:23.750
<i>and the cat, who's getting 
cuddled by Fuyutsuki-san.</i>

08:24.390 --> 08:27.400
<i>I'm too darn jealous of 'em both!</i>

08:28.720 --> 08:31.320
<i>What a complicated feeling!</i>

08:33.030 --> 08:35.960
I'm just glad we managed to catch it.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.280
So am I.

08:37.700 --> 08:39.070
Hey, kitty.

08:40.830 --> 08:43.470
Himuro-kun's a good man.

08:43.470 --> 08:46.040
So don't worry. You're in good hands.

08:48.540 --> 08:50.840
<i>A good man. A good man.</i>

08:50.840 --> 08:53.690
<i>N-Now that she's said that...</i>

08:53.690 --> 08:56.640
<i>Well, even if she hadn't...</i>

08:57.150 --> 09:00.920
<i>I'll guarantee you a comfy life from now on!</i>

09:01.520 --> 09:05.570
Still, it's quite a tame cat, isn't it?

09:05.570 --> 09:08.000
Do you think it's got a family already?

09:10.440 --> 09:12.440
<b>Lost Cat</b>

09:10.440 --> 09:12.440
<b>Buchi</b>

09:10.440 --> 09:12.440
<b>Please Help</b>

09:10.440 --> 09:12.440
<b></b>If you see or catch this cat, please 
contact us with the information below

09:13.150 --> 09:15.500
Y-You don't think...

09:16.200 --> 09:19.630
Are you Buchi-san?

09:28.300 --> 09:29.890
Thank you so much!

09:29.890 --> 09:31.930
Thank you so much!

09:31.930 --> 09:36.210
Buchi here got spooked by some thunder, 
tore through the screen, and ran off!

09:36.210 --> 09:39.760
I'm glad we found the cat's home.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.840
I agree.

09:45.280 --> 09:46.640
Take care.

09:47.210 --> 09:49.460
No more tearing through screens.

09:54.160 --> 09:55.420
Goodbye.

09:55.860 --> 09:58.870
I just can't thank you enough!

10:04.200 --> 10:07.850
Fuyutsuki-san, I'm so sorry.

10:07.850 --> 10:10.320
I kept you out very late.

10:13.200 --> 10:14.800
It worked out well.

10:18.160 --> 10:20.310
<i>Icicles of sorrow...</i>

10:24.010 --> 10:25.340
Himuro-kun?

10:26.320 --> 10:27.390
Yes?

10:27.390 --> 10:30.780
Would you like to stop 
by my place sometime?

10:32.400 --> 10:36.910
Nyamero is a mature cat who 
will offer cuddles on request.

10:37.690 --> 10:39.650
B-But...

10:40.410 --> 10:43.770
I might blizzard.

10:44.780 --> 10:46.760
I'm sure you'll be fine.

10:48.140 --> 10:51.340
You worked so hard to help Buchi-san, after all.

10:52.970 --> 10:56.320
Are you free this coming Sunday?

10:59.350 --> 11:00.790
I certainly am!

11:08.500 --> 11:13.720
<i>Did... Did Fuyutsuki-san 
just invite me over?!</i>

11:20.070 --> 11:20.800
<b></b>Snooze

11:20.070 --> 11:22.070
<b></b>Sunday

11:20.070 --> 11:22.070
<b></b>Alarm

11:20.070 --> 11:22.070
<b></b>Stop

11:24.830 --> 11:28.050
<i>Today's the day I visit Fuyutsuki-san.</i>

11:31.090 --> 11:32.940
Hey, Big Bro!

11:32.940 --> 11:36.290
What's with the blizzards 
first thing in the morning?!

11:37.080 --> 11:39.010
What's up, Yukimi?

11:39.010 --> 11:41.130
You're not usually up this early.

11:41.130 --> 11:43.450
And you seem to be in a good mood.

11:44.040 --> 11:45.400
Shaddup!

11:45.400 --> 11:46.470
Shut it!

11:46.470 --> 11:49.250
It's none of your business!

11:49.250 --> 11:51.790
This is none of your business, either.

11:53.850 --> 11:56.580
Crud, I gotta get going!

11:57.860 --> 12:02.720
<i>I'm sorta curious what's got Yukimi 
feelin' so peppy this morning, but...</i>

12:03.610 --> 12:06.130
<i>No time to worry about her today.</i>

12:09.080 --> 12:11.290
One Midoshima roll cake, please.

12:11.670 --> 12:13.840
No need for a cold pack.

12:16.880 --> 12:19.380
<i>It's my first time visiting her at home.</i>

12:20.170 --> 12:23.230
<i>It's partly so I can get to know 
Nyamero-san, of course.</i>

12:23.830 --> 12:26.120
<i>But... also...</i>

12:26.520 --> 12:30.340
<i>I'd like to get closer to Fuyutsuki-san, as well!</i>

12:30.920 --> 12:32.150
<i>Day after day...</i>

12:34.860 --> 12:37.520
<i>We get along well as colleagues...</i>

12:38.580 --> 12:42.900
<i>But I'd like to occupy a more special 
place in Fuyutsuki-san's heart.</i>

12:43.640 --> 12:47.650
<i>Fuyutsuki-san is equally kind to everyone.</i>

12:48.260 --> 12:50.570
<i>I love that about her, and all...</i>

12:51.680 --> 12:52.840
<i>But still, I...</i>

12:55.160 --> 12:57.430
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's apartment.</i>

12:59.100 --> 13:03.520
<i>At Halloween, I carried 
her things to the door.</i>

13:06.460 --> 13:07.990
<i>But today...</i>

13:12.530 --> 13:13.670
<i>Yes?</i>

13:19.010 --> 13:21.810
Welcome, Himuro-kun.

13:22.230 --> 13:25.550
U-Um... I...

13:25.550 --> 13:27.460
Thank you for...

13:28.740 --> 13:31.800
I think Nyamero is welcoming, you as well.

13:32.700 --> 13:35.730
<i>T-Too darn cute!</i>

13:37.200 --> 13:38.760
Your blizzard...

13:38.760 --> 13:41.040
I managed to hold it in.

13:41.040 --> 13:45.360
The real Nyamero is exponentially
 cuter than in the pictures!

13:45.360 --> 13:47.090
Thank you for saying so.

13:47.090 --> 13:50.190
It's a pleasure to meet you. 
My name is Himuro.

13:50.600 --> 13:54.360
Your whiskers have been 
of great service to me.

13:57.510 --> 13:59.480
Please, come in.

14:00.250 --> 14:03.480
Y-Yes... I will.

14:03.480 --> 14:05.380
Thank you.

14:07.720 --> 14:11.200
Er... you can have this, if you like.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.990
Thank you so much.

14:14.360 --> 14:16.190
<i>What the heck is this?</i>

14:16.190 --> 14:19.750
<i>Just walkin' in the front door... makes me...</i>

14:19.750 --> 14:22.090
<i>Too darn happy!</i>

14:23.250 --> 14:26.790
Himuro-kun, you appear to be sparkling.

14:26.790 --> 14:30.000
Oh... It's diamond dust.

14:31.050 --> 14:33.140
Diamond dust...

14:33.140 --> 14:37.790
It appears when I'm wallowing in quiet bliss.

14:38.460 --> 14:40.510
A new technique?

14:41.780 --> 14:44.650
Still, I understand how you feel.

14:50.320 --> 14:55.110
It really is a delight when 
a cat talks back to you.

14:57.680 --> 14:59.880
<i>It's a little more than that, for me...</i>

14:59.880 --> 15:01.240
Nyamero.

15:01.240 --> 15:03.120
You're in the way.

15:04.750 --> 15:06.320
<i>Cute and...</i>

15:07.120 --> 15:08.800
<i>Cute!</i>

15:09.120 --> 15:10.220
<i>Happy.</i>

15:10.220 --> 15:10.880
Happy!

15:10.880 --> 15:12.800
Happy! Happy!

15:11.610 --> 15:12.800
Yay!

15:15.250 --> 15:17.810
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's apartment...</i>

15:18.220 --> 15:21.320
<i>I'm so psyched to be here, 
I'm at a loss for words!</i>

15:22.110 --> 15:24.680
Since I knew you'd be coming...

15:25.320 --> 15:29.820
<b>Catch Me If You Nyan</b>

15:25.780 --> 15:29.200
I decided to order some new cat toys.

15:35.110 --> 15:38.810
Cat toys are often kind of...

15:38.810 --> 15:41.480
inexplicable, don't you think?

15:41.480 --> 15:43.840
In their design, perhaps.

15:43.840 --> 15:49.080
I'm sure they did tons of research on
 what shapes cats found appealing, though.

15:49.080 --> 15:52.280
Here, Nyame-chan. A new toy.

15:54.590 --> 15:56.750
Not in the mood, I suppose.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.220
Oh, no...

15:58.220 --> 16:02.480
And he goes right for the box 
the toy came from instead...

16:04.590 --> 16:08.080
You can't force a cat to play, 
so let's break out the treats.

16:08.080 --> 16:09.770
R-Right.

16:10.280 --> 16:16.280
Nyamero will have this Chure, 
and we can have the cake you brought.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.870
I'll help.

16:22.390 --> 16:24.120
Thank you very much.

16:24.570 --> 16:25.880
The plates are right—

16:32.790 --> 16:35.520
I-I'm sorry! I bumped into you—

16:35.520 --> 16:36.670
It's not that.

16:41.800 --> 16:44.280
It's not that I was... avoiding it.

16:45.940 --> 16:48.150
What do you...

16:57.850 --> 16:59.380
Coming.

17:04.270 --> 17:06.390
Oh, welcome.

17:10.480 --> 17:14.170
Hello! Thanks for having me!

17:19.920 --> 17:22.970
What are <i>you</i> doing in 
Fuyutsuki-san's apartment?!

17:22.970 --> 17:24.930
That's what I was gonna ask!

17:24.930 --> 17:31.240
I've been stopping by Fuyutsuki-san's place
 when I have time after work lately!

17:31.240 --> 17:32.220
Right?

17:32.220 --> 17:33.100
Yes.

17:33.100 --> 17:35.320
When did you two get so close?

17:35.670 --> 17:38.440
<i>So that's why she was 
all happy this morning?</i>

17:38.640 --> 17:42.220
I'm sorry. I assumed you knew.

17:42.220 --> 17:45.890
No, there's nothing to apologize for.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.640
You've gotta go!

17:48.640 --> 17:52.090
Oh? I wonder why that is...

17:52.880 --> 17:59.830
You wouldn't make me snowmen for
 my New Year's stream, after all...

18:03.830 --> 18:05.600
<i>I was a little too mean.</i>

18:06.080 --> 18:08.380
<i>Well, fine.</i>

18:08.380 --> 18:10.110
Fuyutsuki-san!

18:10.110 --> 18:12.110
I should probably...

18:12.110 --> 18:13.560
Huh?

18:14.040 --> 18:17.800
Himuro-kun, you brought a roll cake?

18:19.640 --> 18:22.440
This can definitely serve three.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.360
I'm glad.

18:26.270 --> 18:28.940
Yay! That's great!

18:29.870 --> 18:31.980
Hey, weren't you leaving?!

18:31.980 --> 18:36.280
It'd be kinda awkward to take off <i>now</i>, man!

18:42.450 --> 18:45.260
Well, shall we?

18:45.550 --> 18:48.110
Yeah! Let's eat!

18:48.110 --> 18:49.520
Let's eat.

18:49.760 --> 18:53.230
<i>I was hopin' I'd have the day 
alone with Fuyutsuki-san...</i>

18:53.640 --> 18:56.410
Isn't it nice to have more people around?

18:59.320 --> 19:00.470
Next time...

19:01.240 --> 19:05.910
Would it be possible for me 
to stop by your house?

19:08.240 --> 19:11.040
Only if you're comfortable 
with it, of course.

19:11.810 --> 19:14.680
You're welcome anytime! Of course!

19:15.300 --> 19:16.860
<i>Yes!</i>

19:16.860 --> 19:20.900
<i>I secured an agreement to see 
Fuyutsuki-san outside the office again!</i>

19:20.900 --> 19:23.240
Big Bro, you're blizzarding!

19:23.240 --> 19:24.680
Might wanna stop that.

19:26.000 --> 19:29.170
N-Nyamero-san...

19:33.100 --> 19:34.920
C'mon...

19:38.520 --> 19:39.590
Darn it.

19:39.590 --> 19:42.620
Your sudden blizzarding spooked the cat.

19:44.070 --> 19:45.920
It's all right.

19:46.310 --> 19:49.450
Nyamuro seems less likely to be angry,

19:49.450 --> 19:52.440
and more likely to be 
enjoying Himuro-kun's snow.

19:54.140 --> 19:56.230
Like cat, like cat-parent, I suppose.

20:00.180 --> 20:03.620
<i>Aw, man, he didn't hear that...</i>

20:09.250 --> 20:10.960
<i>What a relief.</i>

20:12.600 --> 20:14.100
<b>Chure</b>

20:12.600 --> 20:14.100
<b>Chure</b>

20:14.100 --> 20:18.100
<i>In the end, I was able to grow 
closer with Nyamero-san.</i>

20:22.120 --> 20:26.910
<i>I hope Fuyutsuki-san and
 I can keep growing closer, too.</i>

20:29.280 --> 20:31.000
Good morning.

20:31.800 --> 20:34.440
Good morning!

20:34.440 --> 20:36.430
So? How'd it go?

20:36.430 --> 20:38.440
Did you get closer?

20:39.370 --> 20:42.750
H-H-How'd you know about that?!

20:45.830 --> 20:49.140
Oh, with the cat! You meant the cat, right?

20:49.140 --> 20:52.270
I mean, yes, but...

20:52.730 --> 20:55.550
It turned out to be a lost cat,

20:55.550 --> 20:58.130
so I took it back to its owner.

20:58.130 --> 21:01.740
Oh, really?

21:03.000 --> 21:05.730
Was there some kind of 
misunderstanding just now?

21:07.410 --> 21:08.860
What really happened?

21:09.890 --> 21:13.530
Oh, w-well... nothing.

21:14.450 --> 21:16.510
What's all this, now?!

21:16.910 --> 21:18.300
Himuro-san?

21:19.670 --> 21:21.530
It's really nothing!

21:21.530 --> 21:22.430
Good mor—

21:22.430 --> 21:24.050
It's totally something!

21:24.050 --> 21:25.800
It's not, I said!

21:24.640 --> 21:29.670
Himuro-kun, you definitely did something!

21:25.800 --> 21:27.060
Did you have a good day?

21:27.060 --> 21:29.670
It's really, <i>really</i> nothing!

21:29.670 --> 21:32.780
C'mon, tell me! What happened?!

21:30.240 --> 21:32.770
It's nothing! Really nothing!

21:32.770 --> 21:36.280
C'mon, something happened!

21:33.650 --> 21:38.040
They're all getting along 
very well this morning.

21:36.290 --> 21:39.020
You made progress, didn't you?!

23:13.070 --> 23:16.080
<b>South Line Change Gate</b>

23:17.580 --> 23:19.820
Guess it's almost time...

23:21.720 --> 23:22.840
Himuro-kun.

23:34.350 --> 23:39.790
<b>South Line Change Gate</b>
